{"product_id":"geanta","title":"Animal print pony leather bag","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnimal print pony leather bag\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRO: Aceasta geanta spectaculoasa este realizata din piele naturala de ponei, cu un imprimeu leopard care aduce un plus de atitudine si sofisticare fiecarei tinute. Textura bogata a pielii, detaliile fine si finisajele impecabile transforma acest accesoriu intr-o declaratie de stil inconfundabila.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUn must have pentru femeia moderna care apreciaza luxul autentic, calitatea artizanala si un design care nu trece neobservat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDimensiuni - 32 cm lungime, 22 cm inaltime, 15 cm adancime\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEN: Crafted from genuine pony leather, this statement bag features a luxurious leopard print that exudes confidence and timeless glamour . The rich texture of the leather, paired with meticulous craftsmanship and refined details, make it a true symbol of high-end fashion. With its structured silhouette , double top handlers and detachable shoulder strap, this bag offers both versatility and refined elegance- from boardroom meetings to chic evening events. A must have accesory for the modern woman who values authentic luxury, impeccable craftmanship and a bold yet sophisticated aestethic.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDimensions – 32 cm length, 22 cm height, 15 cm depth.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"My Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52110896070992,"sku":"1","price":1700.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-12_at_21.28.27.jpg?v=1760294185","url":"https:\/\/www.dortenzi.com\/products\/geanta","provider":"D’Ortenzi","version":"1.0","type":"link"}